increments.description:
New adt_census_service computes, per hospital-local day (services.hospital_time):
- midnight census;
- admissions, transfers in and out, ends by type, deaths;
- per-stay inpatient days from admissions;
- licensed beds and available beds (census beds minus out-of-service time from housekeeping_unit_events);
- occupancy, ALOS, and return to ICU within 48 h.
Temporary and overflow beds are excluded from the denominator. Every response carries method strings. GET /api/adt/census and CSV; BedBoardPanel Census view. nabh_service computes QI-UTL-01 and QI-OUT-04 for register-complete wards and keeps the cannot-compute reason for the others.
